last minute

4
00:00:04,964 --> 00:00:06,757
but we've decided to
have a Halloween party.

5
00:00:06,757 --> 00:00:08,133
Oh, good.
Great.

6
00:00:08,133 --> 00:00:10,719
And everybody has
to wear costumes.

7
00:00:10,719 --> 00:00:12,513
