14
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:25,192
Not two years in a row.

15
00:00:26,986 --> 00:00:29,864
I'll come to the party,
but I'm not dressing up.

16
00:00:29,864 --> 00:00:30,865
You have to.

17
00:00:30,865 --> 00:00:31,949
No way.

18
00:00:31,949 --> 00:00:33,701
