to be someone you're not?

20
00:00:36,871 --> 00:00:38,330
You're an actor.

21
00:00:39,999 --> 00:00:42,041
So, Ross, are you
going to bring Mona?

22
00:00:42,041 --> 00:00:43,919
Yeah, yeah, I think I will.

23
00:00:43,919 --> 00:00:45,170
The hot girl from their wedding?

24
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:46,547
Yeah.

25
00:00:46,547 --> 00:00:48,423
Well, hey, if she needs
any ideas for costumes

26
00:00:48,423 --> 00:00:52,427
she could be a bikini model
or a slutty nurse

27
00:00:52,427 --> 00:00:54,221
or a sexy cheerleader.

28
00:00:54,221 --> 00:00:57,474
Or, ooh, ooh, Leatherface
from Texas Chain Saw Massacre.

29
00:00:57,474 --> 00:00:58,767
No, no, no.

30
00:00:58,767 --> 00:01:00,769
Slutty Leatherface.

31
00:01:00,769 --> 00:01:03,898
Wasn't Joey hitting on
her at the wedding, too?

32
00:01:03,898 --> 00:01:06,191
That's right.

33
00:01:06,191 --> 00:01:08,276
He was hitting
on her.

34
00:01:08,276 --> 00:01:09,945
And I got her.

35
00:01:09,945 --> 00:01:13,240
I guess the better man won.

36
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:15,826
Please don't
take her from me.

37
00:01:22,583 --> 00:01:27,671
♪ So no one told you
life was gonna be this way ♪

38
00:01:27,671 --> 00:01:30,089
♪ Your job's a joke,
you're broke ♪

39
00:01:30,089 --> 00:01:33,260
♪ Your love life's D.O.A. ♪

40
00:01:33,260 --> 00:01:37,180
♪ It's like you're always
stuck in second gear ♪

41
00:01:37,180 --> 00:01:39,474
♪ When it hasn't been
your day, your week ♪

42
00:01:39,474 --> 00:01:41,769
♪ Your month,
or even your year ♪

43
00:01:41,769 --> 00:01:46,023
♪ But I'll be there for you ♪

44
00:01:46,023 --> 00:01:49,401
♪ 'Cause you're there
for me, too. ♪

45
00:01:57,618 --> 00:01:59,119
Oh. Ursula.

46
00:01:59,119 --> 00:02:00,370
Oh.

47
00:02:00,370 --> 00:02:02,664
Wait. It's...
it's me-- Phoebe.

48
00:02:02,664 --> 00:02:04,541
Oh. I thought there
was a mirror there.

49
00:02:04,541 --> 00:02:06,043
Okay. Bye-bye.

50
