married next week.

54
00:02:14,134 --> 00:02:15,761
What?

55
00:02:15,761 --> 00:02:17,387
Yeah, yeah. It's going
to be a small ceremony.

56
00:02:17,387 --> 00:02:18,513
Just family.

57
00:02:19,556 --> 00:02:21,058
His.

58
00:02:21,058 --> 00:02:22,517
Huh.

59
00:02:22,517 --> 00:02:23,894
Okay.

60
00:02:23,894 --> 00:02:26,063
Well, I'm really
happy for you.

61
00:02:26,063 --> 00:02:27,064
Wait.

62
00:02:27,064 --> 00:02:28,649
If...

63
00:02:28,649 --> 00:02:31,234
If you want to come,
I guess that'd be okay.

64
00:02:31,234 --> 00:02:32,319
Really?

65
00:02:32,319 --> 00:02:33,695
Sure. Why not?

66
00:02:33,695 --> 00:02:35,489
You could be my
"sister" for the day.

67
00:02:35,489 --> 00:02:38,241
Yeah. Okay.

68
00:02:38,241 --> 00:02:40,077
Um, you know,
my friends are having

69
00:02:40,077 --> 00:02:41,369
