so you could come.

71
00:02:43,413 --> 00:02:45,707
Maybe I could meet
the guy you're marrying.

72
00:02:45,707 --> 00:02:47,709
Huh. Well, I'm
supposed to be working

73
00:02:47,709 --> 00:02:49,168
