90
00:03:23,829 --> 00:03:24,955
Okay.

91
00:03:24,955 --> 00:03:26,331
( knock at door )

92
00:03:26,331 --> 00:03:27,457
CHILDREN:
Trick or treat.

93
00:03:27,457 --> 00:03:28,876
Oh, oh, can I
give out the candy?

94
00:03:28,876 --> 00:03:30,836
