equestrian theme going on.

108
00:04:04,203 --> 00:04:07,039
I don't suppose you saw
the cover of British Vogue...

109
00:04:07,039 --> 00:04:08,665
Can I just have a candy?

110
00:04:10,876 --> 00:04:12,377
Yeah.

111
00:04:12,377 --> 00:04:14,129
Sure.

112
00:04:20,552 --> 00:04:24,389
