114
00:04:27,642 --> 00:04:29,186
It's me, Phoebe.

115
00:04:32,106 --> 00:04:35,316
Monica, can I talk
to you for a second?

116
00:04:41,322 --> 00:04:43,617
Listen, I appreciate you
getting me the costume.

117
00:04:43,617 --> 00:04:45,035
