134
00:05:22,114 --> 00:05:24,199
Oh, that is so you!

135
00:05:24,199 --> 00:05:25,993
When have I
ever done that?

136
00:05:25,993 --> 00:05:27,995
When have I ever done that?

137
00:05:27,995 --> 00:05:29,163
