150
00:05:53,812 --> 00:05:56,315
I love you.

151
00:05:56,315 --> 00:05:57,482
Oh, oh!

152
00:05:57,482 --> 00:05:58,650
Aw...

153
00:05:58,650 --> 00:06:00,277
Oh, honey, here,
take it all.

154
00:06:06,658 --> 00:06:08,994
