185
00:07:37,249 --> 00:07:41,086
See, and I knew
that and...

186
00:07:41,086 --> 00:07:42,587
now I'm sweating.

187
00:07:42,587 --> 00:07:44,214
Look, look at me--
I'm really sweating.

188
00:07:44,214 --> 00:07:45,757
I mean, now I'm saying:

189
00:07:45,757 --> 00:07:47,634
Look at me-- I'm
getting even sweatier.

190
00:07:47,634 --> 00:07:49,344
I think I should
probably just go.

191
00:07:49,344 --> 00:07:51,388
No, that's okay.
We'll just start over.

192
00:07:51,388 --> 00:07:52,513
Okay, hi, I'm Phoebe.

193
00:07:52,513 --> 00:07:54,349
Uh, Eric.

194
00:07:54,349 --> 00:07:55,976
