227
00:09:06,587 --> 00:09:07,839
But between you and Phoebe

228
00:09:07,839 --> 00:09:09,424
I'd have to give
the edge to Phoebe.

229
00:09:09,424 --> 00:09:10,675
What? Really?

230
00:09:10,675 --> 00:09:12,260
