and I... have been giving out
money, but I'm out of that, too.

263
00:10:22,163 --> 00:10:23,622
Hey, can I write you a check?

264
00:10:23,622 --> 00:10:24,999
Okay.

265
00:10:24,999 --> 00:10:26,000
